re-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4090650-1842212951296685","game_id":"steam-4090650","kind":"announcement","title":"BERGWERK – A Mining Sim: The Demo is Now Available on Steam! ⛏️","summary":"Gamescom is here! While you can visit us at Hall 9 · Booth B-043, you can also play the BERGWERK – A Mining Sim demo on Steam throughout Gamescom week!⛏️ Play the demo ⛏️ Explore the mine ⛏️ Get a first look at the game in developmentWhether you’re visiting us at Gamescom or playing from home, your feedback is incredibly valuable to us! Tell us what you think and help us shape BERGWERK as development continues.📅 Gamescom: August 26–30, 2026 📍 Hall 9 · Booth B-043👉 Play the demo on Steam and disc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T12:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4090650-1840944183789203","game_id":"steam-4090650","kind":"announcement","title":"\"BERGWERK – A Mining Sim\" is coming to gamescom! ⛏️","summary":"We’re excited to announce that BERGWERK – A Mining Sim will be at gamescom 2026!📅 26–30 August 📍 Hall 9 · Booth B-043Come by, say hello, and get your hands on the game! We’d love to show you what we’ve been working on and hear what you think.Can’t make it to gamescom?You can also play the BERGWERK demo on Steam during gamescom and get a first glimpse into the early development of the game.Your feedback is incredibly valuable to us and will help us shape BERGWERK as development continues.⛏️ Play ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T16:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4090650-1840944183774003","game_id":"steam-4090650","kind":"announcement","title":"🚂 Devblog 01: Railway System 🚂","summary":"⛏️ Devblog 01: The Mine RailwayWelcome to the first BERGWERK devblog!From now on, we’ll be sharing exclusive development content right here on Discord — behind-the-scenes progress, systems we’re working on, and things you won’t see anywhere else.So, let’s head underground. ⛏️ 🚂 The Railway SystemOnce coal is mined, it needs to make its way back to the shaft. In BERGWERK, you build and manage that entire transport network yourself.Lay the tracks, set the junctions, and decide how your mine operat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T13:34:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4090650-1840310314345109","game_id":"steam-4090650","kind":"announcement","title":"⛏️ BERGWERK – A Mining Sim | Join Our Discord! 🏭","summary":"Welcome to the Grubental Coal Mining Region! ⚒️In BERGWERK – A Mining Sim, you build your own mine from the first tunnels all the way to a large-scale mining operation. Explore coal seams, plan your mine, operate heavy machinery, and take on the challenges of underground mining.But BERGWERK isn’t being developed alone – and that’s exactly why we want you to be part of the journey from the very beginning! 👷💬 Join our Discord and become part of the community!Here’s what you can expect:Exclusive Sn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T14:05:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T